01:20:02.846 --> 01:20:04.696
as opposed to when you saw it as a kid?

01:20:04.696 --> 01:20:05.996
- Aw, geeze.
- 'Cause I remember

01:20:05.996 --> 01:20:08.099
the first time it happened to me was,

01:20:08.099 --> 01:20:09.126
I remember when Toy Story 3 got released.

01:20:09.126 --> 01:20:10.096
- I was literally thinking Toy Story 3

01:20:10.096 --> 01:20:11.329
when you said that.
- Yeah.

01:20:11.329 --> 01:20:12.386
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, I
feel that's the only thing

01:20:12.386 --> 01:20:13.957
that's like stuck around, right?

01:20:13.957 --> 01:20:15.866
- I think there's been two,
there's been Toy Story three

01:20:15.866 --> 01:20:17.619
and American Pie Reunion.
- Right.

01:20:17.619 --> 01:20:19.319
(laughter)

01:20:19.319 --> 01:20:21.166
