01:20:23.781 --> 01:20:26.396
was like, 'cause like when American,

01:20:26.396 --> 01:20:28.506
when American Pie one
and two got released,

01:20:28.506 --> 01:20:32.076
it was fucking massive during,
not even like my generations,

01:20:32.076 --> 01:20:34.076
but I think like I
already saw American Pie

01:20:34.076 --> 01:20:36.073
because it was like my
older cousins' generation

01:20:36.073 --> 01:20:38.933
and they would like put it
on TV and I'm just like,

01:20:38.933 --> 01:20:40.596
"There's fucking boobs,

01:20:40.596 --> 01:20:42.913
what the fuck is going on here?"

01:20:44.005 --> 01:20:44.936
- [Joey] "Am I even allowed to be here?"

01:20:44.936 --> 01:20:47.006
- "Am I allowed to be here?"
- Imagine that came out today.

01:20:47.006 --> 01:20:49.876
- Yeah, no, oh my God but
I remember watching like,

01:20:49.876 --> 01:20:52.566
'cause that's how I experienced
American Pie one and two

01:20:52.566 --> 01:20:54.106
and it was fucking massive and then

01:20:54.106 --> 01:20:56.266
seeing American Pie Reunion
and just seeing everyone

01:20:56.266 --> 01:20:58.926
as just like responsible adults

01:20:58.926 --> 01:21:02.246
and just like being adults.
- That's what that's about?

01:21:02.246 --> 01:21:03.566
- Yeah, having like children, like,

01:21:03.566 --> 01:21:05.369
'cause they have a high school reunion

01:21:05.369 --> 01:21:07.976
and you see these
characters and they're, one,

01:21:07.976 --> 01:21:11.376
they're like a lot older
and people have jobs

